{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">स्पष्टीकरण-पुस्तिका</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">सोबतची</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">देल्मास साहाय्यक तक्त्यांची</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">पहिली मालिका</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">तक्ता क्रमांक १</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">शाळा. — माध्यमिक शाळा. — वर्ग.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">सर्वसाधारण वर्णन.</span>","t01-01-1":"१. — हा तक्ता माध्यमिक <b>शाळेतला</b> एक <b>वर्ग</b> दाखवतो. या वर्गात आठ <b>टेबले</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> आणि आठ <b>बाक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button> आहेत. प्रत्येक बाकावर तीन विद्यार्थी बसतात. आणि <b>गुरुजी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> आपल्या <b>खुर्चीवर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> आपल्या <b>व्यासपीठासमोर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> बसले आहेत.","t01-02-1":"२. — व्यासपीठाच्या डावीकडे काचेचे <b>कपाट</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> आहे. उजवीकडे <b>फळा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> आहे, त्याच्यासोबत <b>फडके</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> आणि <b>खडू</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"आणि व्यासपीठाच्या वर <b>भिंतीवरचे तक्ते</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> व <b>नकाशा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button> टांगलेले आहेत.","t01-03-1":"३. — सगळे विद्यार्थी आपापल्या <b>जागेवर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> नाहीत. जॉन <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> फळ्याजवळ उभा आहे; तो फडके धरून <b>भूमितीच्या आकृत्या</b> पुसतो आहे.","t01-03-2":"आणि पीटर व्यासपीठाजवळ आहे; तो <b>लेखी कामे</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> गोळा करून गुरुजींकडे नेतो आहे.","t01-04-1":"४. — <b>हे</b> गुरुजी <b>आधुनिक भाषांचे</b> शिक्षक आहेत. ते विद्यार्थ्यांना परकीय भाषा बोलायला, वाचायला आणि लिहायला शिकवतात <b>(जर्मन, इंग्रजी, स्पॅनिश, इटालियन, रशियन</b> किंवा <b>फ्रेंच)</b>.","t01-05-1":"५. — वर्ग खूप प्रशस्त आणि खूप उजेडाचा आहे. त्याच्या टोकाला रुंद <b>खिडकी</b> आहे, तिला दोन <b>झरोके</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> आहेत, आणि <b>काचेचे दार</b> आहे — हवा आणि उजेड येण्यासाठी.","t01-05-2":"आणि हा वर्ग थंड नाही. त्याच्या मधोमध, ऊब मिळावी म्हणून, एक खूप चांगली <b>शेगडी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> तिच्या <b>धुराड्यासह</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button> आहे.","t01-05-3":"आणि आडभिंतीवर <b>खुंट्या</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> बसवलेल्या आहेत; त्यांवर विद्यार्थी आपल्या टोप्या व कोट टांगतात.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">खेळाचे पटांगण.</span>","t01-06-1":"६. — <b>घड्याळ</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> नऊ वाजून पाच मिनिटे दाखवते आहे.","t01-06-2":"<b>मधली सुट्टी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> आत्ताच संपली आणि तास पुन्हा सुरू होतो आहे. खेळ <b>पटांगणात</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button> होतो. आपल्याला काही विद्यार्थी खेळताना दिसतात. <b>शिक्षकांचा मदतनीस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> त्यांच्यावर लक्ष ठेवतो आहे.","t01-07-1":"७. — पटांगणात आणखीही निरनिराळी माणसे दिसतात, म्हणजे <b>निरीक्षक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>मुख्याध्यापक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button>, आणि <b>उपमुख्याध्यापक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"निरीक्षक शाळांची तपासणी करतो, मुख्याध्यापक शाळा चालवतात, आणि उपमुख्याध्यापक अभ्यासावर लक्ष ठेवतात.","t01-07-3":"आणि चौथी व्यक्ती म्हणजे <b>शिपाई</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. गैरहजर विद्यार्थ्यांची नोंद करण्यासाठी तो काखेत हजेरीपुस्तक घेऊन फिरतो.","t01-08-1":"८. — पटांगणाच्या टोकाला <b>व्यायामाची साधने</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> आहेत, आणि <b>हस्तकलेची</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> कार्यशाळा आहे.","t01-08-2":"आणि तक्त्याच्या उजवीकडे <b>संगीताचा</b> व <b>चित्रकलेचा</b> <b>वर्ग</b> दिसू लागतो.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">सविस्तर वर्णन.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">हुशार विद्यार्थी.</span>","t01-09-1":"९. — व्यासपीठाच्या उजवीकडच्या पहिल्या बाकावरचे विद्यार्थी म्हणजे <b>हेन्री</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"mr-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>स्टीफन</b> आणि <b>चार्ल्स</b>.","t01-09-2":"हेन्री खूप लक्ष देतो आणि कष्टाळू आहे; तो गुरुजींचे ऐकतो. त्याच्या टेबलावर <b>वही</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>पुस्तक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>शब्दकोश</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> आणि <b>कंपासपेटी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button> आहे. त्याच्या पुस्तकाला पुष्कळ <b>पाने</b> आहेत, प्रत्येक प्रकरणात अनेक <b>परिच्छेद</b> आहेत आणि प्रत्येक <b>ओळीत</b> पुष्कळ <b>शब्द</b> आहेत.","t01-09-4":"त्याचा शेजारी स्टीफन <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> मेहनती आहे. पुढच्या वेळचा धडा तो आपल्या वहीत लिहून घेतो आहे. त्याचे <b>हस्ताक्षर</b> सुंदर आहे. त्याचे पुस्तक मिटलेले आहे. आपल्याला फक्त <b>मुखपृष्ठ</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button> दिसते. त्याच्याजवळ त्याचा <b>कंपास</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button> आहे.","t01-09-5":"चार्ल्स <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> हाताने आपले पुस्तक धरून आहे; धडा पुन्हा वाचण्यासाठी तो ते उघडतो आहे. प्रत्येक विद्यार्थ्याप्रमाणे त्याच्याही समोर <b>शाईदाणी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> आहे. तो आज्ञाधारक आहे.","t01-10-1":"१०. — शेजारच्या टेबलावर <b>लुई</b>, <b>अँटनी</b> आणि <b>पॉल</b> आहेत. लुई आपला <b>धडा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> म्हणून दाखवतो आहे आणि गुरुजींच्या <b>प्रश्नांची</b> उत्तरे देतो आहे. अँटनी <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> अजिबात लक्ष देत नाही, कधीकधी तर गुरुजी त्याला शिक्षा करतात. पॉल <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> चांगला सोबती आहे, प्रेमळ आणि मदत करणारा. आणि तो खूप लक्ष देतो.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">वाईट विद्यार्थी.</span>","t01-11-1":"११. — हेन्रीच्या मागे <b>जॉर्ज</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button> बसतो. तो वाईट मुलगा नाही, पण <b>बडबड्या</b>, बेलक्ष आणि खोडकर आहे. त्याच्या <b>चंचलपणामुळे</b> व <b>अवखळपणामुळे</b> तासात <b>गोंधळ</b> होतो आणि कितीदा तरी त्याला कडक <b>ताकीद</b> मिळते. त्याची <b>खरडवही</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> मळकट आहे, तो आपल्या <b>टाकाने</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> तिच्यावर <b>शाईचे डाग पाडतो</b>, आणि म्हणूनच तो नेहमी आपले <b>खोडरबर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> वापरतो; त्याचे <b>दप्तर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> फाटलेले आहे, कारण तो खूप निष्काळजी आहे. मग <b>आधुनिक भाषांच्या</b> वर्गात तो आपली <b>पेन्सिलपेटी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> कशाला आणतो?","t01-11-2":"त्याचा शेजारी एडमंड <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> त्याला आवडत नाही. खरे तर तो जरा आळशी आहे, पण गप्प आणि शांत आहे. तो बडबड करत नाही; मात्र ऐकण्याऐवजी त्याला आपल्या <b>वाचनाच्या पुस्तकातल्या</b> <b>गोष्टी</b> वाचायला आवडतात.","t01-11-3":"या बाकावरचा तिसरा विद्यार्थी म्हणजे <b>लुई</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. तो मेहनती आहे. तो पांढऱ्या <b>कागदावर</b> लिहितो आहे. आणि समोर त्याने आपला <b>टीपकागद</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button> ठेवला आहे.","t01-12-1":"१२. — गुरुजींच्या डावीकडच्या दुसऱ्या बाकावरचे विद्यार्थी खूप लहान आहेत. पहिला, लहानगा <b>एमिल</b>, अजून नीट लिहू शकत नाही; तो आपली <b>पाटी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, आपली <b>पाटीपेन्सिल</b> आणि आपला <b>स्पंज</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> आणतो.","t01-12-2":"त्याच्या शेजारी <b>ऑगस्ट</b> आणि <b>बर्नार्ड</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button> आहेत. हा चांगला अभ्यास करतो, पण त्याचे <b>कपडे</b> फार अव्यवस्थित असतात.","t01-13-1":"१३. — त्यांच्या मागे तीन <b>आळशी</b> आहेत. <b>अल्बर्ट</b> आपले धडे शिकत नाही. <b>जेम्स</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> ऐकण्याऐवजी झोपतो. त्याच्या <b>आळसामुळे</b> त्याला <b>बोलणी</b> आणि <b>शिक्षाही</b> मिळते. आणि शेवटी <b>ख्रिश्चन</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> फारच बेजबाबदार आहे. त्याची <b>वागणूक</b> वाईट आहे आणि सुधारण्याचा तो अजिबात प्रयत्न करत नाही.","t01-14-1":"१४. — याउलट त्याचे शेजारी <b>सुस्वभावी</b> आहेत. <b>अर्नेस्ट</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> याला टापटीप आणि नियमितपणा आवडतो; तो नेहमी आपली <b>पट्टी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> आणि आपली <b>पेन्सिल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button> वापरतो. तो <b>बाहेरून येणारा विद्यार्थी</b> आहे.","t01-14-2":"<b>फ्रान्सिस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>वसतिगृहात राहणारा</b> आहे; तो गणवेश घालतो, शाळेतच जेवतो आणि झोपतो. तो चांगला <b>सोबती</b> आहे.","t01-14-3":"मॉरिस आपल्या <b>चाकूने</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> आपली <b>पेन्सिल</b> तासतो; तो खूप काळजी घेणारा आहे.","t01-14-4":"तो आपली सगळी पुस्तके आणतो, आपले <b>व्याकरण</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, आपली <b>टिपणवही</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, आणि <b>लिहिण्याची उशीसुद्धा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. त्याचे <b>दप्तर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> त्याच्या मागे जमिनीवर आहे.","t01-14-5":"वर्गाच्या टोकाची दोन टेबले <b>हुशार विद्यार्थ्यांनी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> भरलेली आहेत.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">चित्रकला आणि संगीत.</span>","t01-15-1":"१५. — <b>चित्रकलेच्या वर्गात</b> भिंतीवर सुंदर <b>नमुने</b> टांगलेले आहेत आणि छताला <b>शेडसह</b> एक <b>दिवा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> लटकवलेला आहे. <b>शिक्षक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> खूप संयमी आहेत; ते विद्यार्थ्यांची <b>चित्रे</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> सुधारतात आणि त्यांना निसर्गावरून <b>अर्धपुतळा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> काढायला शिकवतात.","t01-16-1":"१६. — <b>संगीताचा वर्ग</b> फार रंजक वाटतो. तिथे <b>संगीत</b> वाचायला शिकतात, <b>रेघांच्या ओळीवर</b> लिहिलेले <b>स्वर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> म्हणायला शिकतात (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), <b>किल्ल्या</b> ओळखायला शिकतात आणि गोड <b>चाली</b> गायला शिकतात. संगीताची पाने <b>मेजपाटीवर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> ठेवतात. एक विद्यार्थी <b>पियानो वाजवतो</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> आणि <b>संगीतशिक्षक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>ताल धरतात</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"१७. — आपल्याला <b>हस्तकलेच्या</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> <b>कार्यशाळेचा</b> एक कोपरा दिसतो, जिथे मुले लाकडाला रंधा मारायला आणि लोखंडाला कानस लावायला शिकू शकतात. हे सगळ्या माध्यमिक शाळांत नसते.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">विज्ञानाचा वर्ग.</span>","t01-18-1":"१८. — गणिताचे शिक्षक विद्यार्थ्यांना <b>भूमिती, अंकगणित, गणिती क्रिया</b> आणि <b>मापनपद्धती</b> शिकवतात. तक्त्यावर आपल्याला मुख्य भूमितीय आकृत्या दिसतात: <b>वर्तुळ</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>चौरस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>त्रिकोण</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>रेषा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"आपल्याला एक <b>क्रियाही</b> दिसते; ती <b>बेरीज</b> नाही, <b>वजाबाकी</b> नाही, <b>गुणाकारही</b> नाही — ती <b>भागाकार</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button> आहे.","t01-19-1":"१९. — मापनपद्धतीच्या तक्त्यावर आपल्याला दिसते: <b>मीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>तराजू</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> आणि त्याची <b>वजने</b>, <b>लिटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>डेकालिटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>डेसिलिटर</b> आणि <b>घनमीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"विद्यार्थी <b>निसर्गविज्ञानही</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> शिकतात — प्राणिशास्त्र <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, वनस्पतिशास्त्र <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, भूशास्त्र <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — आणि <b>इतिहास</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"कपाटात <b>भौतिकशास्त्राची</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> आणि <b>रसायनशास्त्राची</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> उपकरणे आहेत.","t01-19-4":"कपाटावर आहेत: <b>गोल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>शंकू</b> आणि <b>पृथ्वीगोल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"तक्त्यांच्या वर जगाचे पाच भाग दाखवणारा <b>नकाशा</b> टांगलेला आहे: <b>युरोप</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>आशिया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>आफ्रिका</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>अमेरिका</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> आणि <b>ऑस्ट्रेलिया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, आणि दोन मोठे महासागर — <b>पॅसिफिक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> आणि <b>अटलांटिक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>बाप्तिस्म्याच्या नावांसाठीही</i> ती लॅटिन रूपात लिहावीत असा सल्ला दिला जातो. असंख्य फरक टाळण्याचा तोच एक मार्ग आहे. शिवाय <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> इत्यादींपैकी निवड कशी करायची? बाप्तिस्म्याच्या नावांसाठी वेगळा शब्दकोश करायचा का? लॅटिनमधून त्यांचे प्रथमा रूप घेऊन म्हणू या: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus;</b> <b>Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)."}}
